-// their 14.5.2 / 14.5.4 launch schedules in capture mode (tau = (s - s_launch) / 2.5); face B above y 0 is absent for z 115..275
-// (agreement 5, the garden notch), so the spec's "face B at x 0" of KS04 / KS07 is checked on the notch flanks.
-// Rules: Whole = every sample inside the frame with the 3 % margin; Part = at least MinPartSamples samples inside the margin (large
-// or open subjects: faces, facades, lanes, the cloud); Info = reported only.
-using System;
-using System.Collections.Generic;
